&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own visual direction on launch storytelling projects from early concepting to final delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Push new visual formats and directions; don&#39;t just execute the existing playbook&lt;/li&gt;
