&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re always the one handed the hardest, vaguest, most important problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pair a top-tier strategy foundation (management consulting, private equity, or investing) with operating experience at a high-growth software company (Product, Growth, Strategy &amp;amp; Ops, or BizOps) or a top-tier PE/VC firm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a track record of taking ambiguous, company-defining problems from zero structure to executive decision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate with exec-level clarity and influence senior leaders without authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reason fluently about a P&amp;amp;L and a business model — strong business and financial instincts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;While it&#39;s not required, it&#39;s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
