&lt;p&gt;This is a full time role held from our San Francisco hub.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do at Figma:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the strategic People Partner to Figma’s CTO and Chief Design Officer, building the credibility and trust to influence how they lead, organize, and grow their teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a talented team of People Partners across the Product, Design and Engineering organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and execute our People Programs such as org design, resource management, performance, and change management through periods of rapid scaling, reorganization, and shifting priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the core people cycles for your orgs across performance, calibration, talent reviews, succession planning while raising the bar on quality and consistency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across the People function and our cross functional partners to help execute the People strategy across the PDE organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and insights to inform your point of view, measure impact, and tell a compelling story to the leaders you support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape and scale the People Partner function itself - developing partners, strengthening the operating model, and modeling what great looks like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience as a People Partner leader in high-growth environments, including managing a team and partnering directly with executive leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of supporting Product, Design, and/or Engineering organizations, with genuine fluency in how technical and design teams operate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business and technical acumen - the ability to build deep product and technical knowledge and understand how the business operates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to challenge and advise senior leaders, influencing decisions and outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
