&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Executive Assistant who has supported at a VP level in complex global markets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time role based in our São Paulo hub and requires fluency in both Portuguese and English.&lt;/p&gt;
