&lt;li&gt;Brief and prepare Sr. Directors ahead of key meetings, calls, and events, including confidential reports and materials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate Senior Management meetings, including agendas, materials, action items, and follow-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead planning and execution of monthly and quarterly meetings and in-person leadership offsites, coordinating content, slides, venues, and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build executive materials using Figma, Figma Slides, and FigJam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key liaison between Sr. Directors, their leadership teams, and the wider LATAM + DACH teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside the Sales EA team and greater EA team to provide some support for logistics of internal events, team offsites and external events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve and create processes for efficiency and global alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in an administrative or support role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in both Portuguese and English, with strong communication skills across a wide range of stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in fast-paced environments and adapt quickly to changing priorities and demands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert at prioritizing, anticipating needs, and handling sensitive information with discretion and confidentiality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a positive, reliable approach and foster an inclusive environment where others can thrive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;While it’s not required, it’s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience supporting customer facing teams and/or sales&lt;/li&gt;
