&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll serve as a trusted advisor throughout the search process - from shaping the role and talent strategy through offer and close. You&#39;ll bring a strong point of view on the executive talent market, leading talent mapping, market research, and competitive intelligence to help leaders make thoughtful hiring decisions. Along the way, you&#39;ll build trusted relationships with exceptional senior leaders and deliver a high-touch candidate experience. Given the visibility and confidential nature of these searches, you&#39;ll operate with a high degree of autonomy, judgment, and discretion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full time role that can be held from one of our US hubs or remotely in the United States.&lt;/p&gt;
