&lt;li&gt;Own full-cycle executive searches end-to-end, from intake and role scoping through pipeline generation, assessment, offer negotiation, and close - for Director, VP, and above roles across the entire Figma business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a strategic partner and trusted advisor to senior hiring leaders, helping shape search strategy, calibrate candidate profiles, and navigate org design and talent decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead in-depth talent mapping and market research across industries, competitors, and adjacent spaces to build a real-time understanding of the executive talent landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a brand steward, ensuring every touchpoint—with candidates, hiring leaders, and the business—reflects Figma&#39;s values, quality, and attention to craft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead offer strategy and negotiation for senior candidates, balancing candidate experience with business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously refine search and partnership approaches based on market signals, hiring outcomes, and stakeholder feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
