&lt;li&gt;Focus primarily on maintaining the Salesforce Partner Ecosystem (Experience Cloud), sitting at the intersection of GTM Systems and Partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain scalable processes for partner onboarding, engagement tracking, and revenue attribution&lt;/li&gt;
