&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Knowledge of US Federal or public sector partner motions and procurement processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience developing partner programs in Latin America, including Spanish and / or Portuguese language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Previous time inside a global SI or professional services firm in a client-delivery or alliance management capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with UX/UI design principles, collaboration tools, and AI-supported digital product development workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
