&lt;li&gt;8+ years in HRIS or People Technology, with deep expertise in Workday configuration across HCM, Advanced Compensation, Benefits, Payroll, Absence, and Integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success leading and developing high-performing HRIS or People Technology teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ownership of Workday delivery, including configuration governance, project intake, prioritization, sprint planning, and release management within a SOX-compliant environment&lt;/li&gt;
