&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in office management, people operations, HR coordination, or similar roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage confidential information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English required; additional languages a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in managing local Health and Safety processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
