&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional Payroll teams to define requirements, manage dependencies, identify risks, and drive projects to completion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Benefits, HRIS, Accounting, People, and other partners to translate business changes into effective payroll solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with global payroll vendors to drive project delivery, resolve implementation or operational issues, and escalate risks as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to simplify, standardize, automate, and improve payroll processes across regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support payroll operations across the full cycle, including review, validation, troubleshooting, and processing coverage when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help establish scalable program management practices, documentation, and visibility across the global payroll portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data, technology, automation, and AI where appropriate to improve payroll efficiency, controls, and Figmate experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
