&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading payroll implementations, vendor transitions, system integrations, or other complex payroll programs, including international expansion or new-country launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on knowledge of payroll operations from processing through reconciliation and issue resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with global payroll vendors and cross-functional stakeholders; Workday experience required&lt;/li&gt;
