&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience managing partnerships with AI model providers, frontier AI companies, or open-weight model ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating early access programs or product and technical evaluations with AI providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
