&lt;p&gt;We are currently hiring for two roles in the Corporate Accounting Team:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Accountant - General &amp;amp; Administrative Expense Accounting&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own G&amp;amp;A cross-functional partnership, cash, corporate card, travel &amp;amp; expense, payroll &amp;amp; benefits accounting, intercompany and consolidations, with flux analysis and technical reporting for assigned areas. Scope may evolve as the team grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Accountant - Sales &amp;amp; Marketing Expense Accounting&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own S&amp;amp;M partnership across functions, ASC 842 lease accounting, capitalized software, prepaids, fixed assets, intangibles &amp;amp; goodwill, and OPEX allocations, including flux review and reporting for your assigned scope. Scope may evolve as the team grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full time role that can be held from one of our US hubs or remotely in the United States.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do at Figma:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own month-end and quarter-end close activities, including journal entries, accruals, account reconciliations, and financial reporting for your assigned areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depending on the role, own accounting for areas including cash &amp;amp; treasury, intercompany, consolidations, corporate card, travel &amp;amp; expense (T&amp;amp;E), payroll &amp;amp; benefits, ASC 842 leases, capitalized software, prepaids, fixed assets, intangibles &amp;amp; goodwill, and OPEX allocations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare monthly and quarterly flux analyses and reporting packages for your assigned areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with G&amp;amp;A or S&amp;amp;M business stakeholders - providing accounting guidance, preparing accruals, and supporting projects and initiatives - to ensure accurate, timely accounting&lt;/li&gt;
