&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with NetSuite or equivalent ERP systems, leveraging automation and AI tools to streamline accounting workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build cross-functional partnerships and communicate effectively with stakeholders across all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Excel skills, including Power Query and complex formulas, to produce audit-ready reporting and analysis&lt;/li&gt;
